 "summary": "A bare quartz resonator, AT cut and running on its fundamental, offered at any nominal frequency from 8 MHz to 64 MHz in a four-pad SMD body 3.2 mm by 2.5 mm and 0.7 mm tall. The resonator sits between pads 1 and 3; pads 2 and 4 are ground. Load capacitance comes as 10 pF or 20 pF and tolerance at 25 °C as ±10 ppm or ±20 ppm, other values to order. It is aimed at IoT devices, wearables and communication equipment.",
